Package: keengen
Version: 0.1.5-1
Depends:
Section: net
Architecture: mipsel-3.4
Maintainer: keengen contributors
Source: https://github.com/vanuska/keengen
Description: XKeen config generator UI for Keenetic Entware (port 1001). Bundles static web + mipsel keengen-httpd (local read/write API). Not a replacement for XKeen-UI. Do not expose to WAN.
